{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S05、S01等短时段的感受信息偏密，部分意象也有堆叠和跳跃，人物心理主线不如X连贯；X的完整叙述更稳。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的【】强调让普通观众扫一眼就能抓住每段的心理重心，短句也更容易在听音乐时分段接收；部分感受按音乐小节出现，能提供更细致的听觉和身体体验，而不必一次读完所有文字。X的长句在解释人物动机、串联前因后果方面更有优势，但整体更依赖观众持续阅读。综合这五项，Y在屏幕观看和音乐同步体验上略胜一筹，代价是局部信息密度和叙事连贯性有所下降。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e7cd786f-20c0-459b-98cc-bddebfc59ca1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T195241566476Z", "elapsed_seconds": 208.406, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:56:09.973501+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c8e137b39f8bd4a3702bdb6b12f48610ea338c625c503ccc6cce180c3604ef1e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachm